---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: false
description: Rohi Group of Schools — raising principled leaders through sound education in Abeokuta, Ogun State.
hasHero: true
---

<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<section class="hero">
  <div id="heroCarousel" class="carousel slide carousel-fade" data-bs-ride="carousel" data-bs-interval="6500">
    <div class="carousel-inner">
      <div class="carousel-item active">
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image:url('/img/hero1.jpg')"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel-item">
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image:url('/img/hero2.jpg')"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel-item">
        <div class="hero-slide" style="background-image:url('/img/hero3.jpg')"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-scrim"></div>

  <!-- Copy sits outside the carousel so it never slides away mid-read. -->
  <div class="hero-content container-wide">
    <span class="hero-eyebrow"><i class="bi bi-stars"></i> Kindergarten → Senior Secondary</span>
    <h1 class="hero-title">Raising principled leaders through sound education.</h1>
    <p class="hero-lede">
      A Christian foundation, strong academics and real character formation —
      in the heart of Abeokuta, Ogun State.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary-solid">Apply for admission <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a>
      <a href="/about/" class="btn-ghost btn-on-dark">Explore the school</a>
    </div>

    <dl class="hero-stats">
      <div><dt>KG–SSS</dt><dd>Full pathway</dd></div>
      <div><dt>2 Campuses</dt><dd>Ogun Radio &amp; Olomore</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Portal</dt><dd>Results online</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-dots">
    <button type="button" data-bs-target="#heroCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="0" class="active" aria-label="Slide 1"></button>
    <button type="button" data-bs-target="#heroCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="1" aria-label="Slide 2"></button>
    <button type="button" data-bs-target="#heroCarousel" data-bs-slide-to="2" aria-label="Slide 3"></button>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ PILLARS ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <div class="section-head center reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Why Rohi</span>
      <h2>An education that forms the whole child</h2>
      <p class="section-lede">Academics, character and confidence — developed together, not traded off.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="pillar-grid reveal-stagger">
      <article class="pillar">
        <span class="pillar-icon" style="--c:var(--brand)"><i class="bi bi-mortarboard-fill"></i></span>
        <h3>Strong academics</h3>
        <p>A rigorous curriculum from Kindergarten through Senior Secondary, with continuous assessment and CBT examinations.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="pillar">
        <span class="pillar-icon" style="--c:var(--accent)"><i class="bi bi-heart-fill"></i></span>
        <h3>Character first</h3>
        <p>Punctuality, honesty and respect are taught and assessed termly alongside every academic subject.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="pillar">
        <span class="pillar-icon" style="--c:var(--sky)"><i class="bi bi-tools"></i></span>
        <h3>Practical skills</h3>
        <p>Vocational practicals sit beside academic theory, so students leave able to do as well as to know.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="pillar">
        <span class="pillar-icon" style="--c:#1a7f42"><i class="bi bi-people-fill"></i></span>
        <h3>Close community</h3>
        <p>Small classes and an open-door staff room mean no child moves through unnoticed.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ PATHWAY ============
     One continuous route rather than five stacked cards — a parent reads it as
     "my child can start here and finish here", and it stays one band tall. -->
<section class="section section-tint" id="pathway">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <div class="section-head center reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">One school, all the way through</span>
      <h2>From first day to final certificate</h2>
      <p class="section-lede">A child can join us at creche and leave with WASSCE and NECO — without ever changing school.</p>
    </div>

    <ol class="pathway reveal-stagger">
      <li class="pathway-step">
        <span class="pathway-dot"><i class="bi bi-balloon-heart-fill"></i></span>
        <h3>Pre-KG &amp; KG</h3>
        <p>Literacy, numeracy, habits and play — settling in gently.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="pathway-step">
        <span class="pathway-dot"><i class="bi bi-pencil-fill"></i></span>
        <h3>Nursery</h3>
        <p>Letter and number work, Yoruba, rhymes and first science.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="pathway-step">
        <span class="pathway-dot"><i class="bi bi-book-fill"></i></span>
        <h3>Primary</h3>
        <p>The full primary curriculum, with ICT and creative arts throughout.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="pathway-step">
        <span class="pathway-dot"><i class="bi bi-easel-fill"></i></span>
        <h3>Junior Secondary</h3>
        <p>Core subjects plus trade skills, working towards BECE.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="pathway-step is-final">
        <span class="pathway-dot"><i class="bi bi-mortarboard-fill"></i></span>
        <h3>Senior Secondary</h3>
        <p>Science, Arts or Commercial tracks, finishing at WASSCE and NECO.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <p class="pathway-note reveal">
      <i class="bi bi-patch-check-fill"></i>
      Rohi College opened in 2015. Our first graduating class sat WASSCE and NECO in 2022 — and passed in full.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ NEWS ============ -->
<section class="section reveal" id="news">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <div class="news-head">
      <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:0">
        <span class="eyebrow">Newsroom</span>
        <h2>Keep up with us</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="/news/" class="btn-ghost">All news <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a>
    </div>

    {% if announcements.length %}
      <div class="news-grid">
        {% for post in announcements | head(3) %}
          <a class="news-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
            <div class="news-card-media">
              {% if post.coverUrl %}
                <img src="{{ post.coverUrl }}" alt="{{ post.cover_image_alt or post.title }}" loading="lazy">
              {% else %}
                <div class="news-placeholder"><i class="bi bi-newspaper"></i></div>
              {% endif %}
              <span class="chip chip-{{ post.category | lower }}">{{ post.category }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="news-card-body">
              <time datetime="{{ post.publish_at }}">{{ post.dateObj | date("MMM dd, yyyy") }}</time>
              <h3>{{ post.title }}</h3>
              {% if post.excerpt %}<p class="news-excerpt">{{ post.excerpt }}</p>{% endif %}
              <span class="news-readmore">Read more <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></span>
            </div>
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <div class="empty-note"><i class="bi bi-newspaper"></i><h3>No news yet</h3><p>Updates will appear here soon.</p></div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ GALLERY (admin-managed) ============ -->
<section class="section section-tint reveal" id="school-gallery">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <div class="section-head center reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Life at Rohi</span>
      <h2>Our school in pictures</h2>
      <p class="section-lede">Moments from classrooms, cultural days and everything in between.</p>
    </div>

    {% if gallery.total %}
      <div class="segmented" role="tablist" id="galleryTabs">
        {% for album in gallery.albums %}
          {% if album.images.length %}
            <button class="segmented-btn {% if loop.first %}active{% endif %}"
                    data-bs-toggle="pill" data-bs-target="#album-{{ album.key }}"
                    type="button" role="tab">
              {{ album.label }} <span class="segmented-count">{{ album.images.length }}</span>
            </button>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="tab-content">
        {% for album in gallery.albums %}
          {% if album.images.length %}
            <div class="tab-pane fade {% if loop.first %}show active{% endif %}" id="album-{{ album.key }}" role="tabpanel">
              <div class="gallery-grid">
                {% for img in album.images %}
                  <button class="gallery-item" type="button"
                          data-full="{{ img.full }}" data-alt="{{ img.alt }}"
                          data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#lightbox">
                    <img src="{{ img.thumb }}" alt="{{ img.alt }}" loading="lazy">
                    <span class="gallery-zoom"><i class="bi bi-arrows-fullscreen"></i></span>
                  </button>
                {% endfor %}
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <div class="empty-note">
        <i class="bi bi-images"></i>
        <h3>Gallery coming soon</h3>
        <p>Photos are managed from the school dashboard and will appear here once uploaded.</p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <div class="modal fade" id="lightbox" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-xl">
      <div class="modal-content bg-transparent border-0">
        <button type="button" class="lightbox-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"><i class="bi bi-x-lg"></i></button>
        <img id="lightboxImg" class="lightbox-img" src="" alt="">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ CTA ============ -->
<section class="cta-band reveal">
  <div class="container-wide cta-inner">
    <div>
      <h2>Admissions are open for 2026/2027</h2>
      <p>Kindergarten through Senior Secondary. Come for a tour, meet the teachers, and we’ll take you
        through entry assessment, fees and start dates in a single visit.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cta-actions">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary-solid">Contact admissions <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a>
      <a href="tel:+2347031362416" class="btn-ghost btn-on-dark"><i class="bi bi-telephone-fill"></i> +234 703 136 2416</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  // Lightbox swaps in the full-resolution rendition; the grid only ever
  // loads the small one, which matters on mobile data.
  document.querySelectorAll('.gallery-item').forEach(function (btn) {
    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var img = document.getElementById('lightboxImg');
      img.src = btn.dataset.full;
      img.alt = btn.dataset.alt || '';
    });
  });
  document.querySelectorAll('.segmented-btn').forEach(function (b) {
    b.addEventListener('click', function () {
      document.querySelectorAll('.segmented-btn').forEach(function (x) { x.classList.remove('active'); });
      b.classList.add('active');
    });
  });
</script>
